{"unit_id":"NoiraBaka__dsh-compact-suite#feature-1","repo":"NoiraBaka/dsh-compact-suite","commit":"89700e4e4a6a1889635ec9ce5beb126901492bf7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compact-suite 的功能「压缩阈值控制」：接管 DSH 压缩引擎并按滑块设置触发比例。用户可在面板调整比例，启用或暂停控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:796-858","lib/index.js:2483-2498"]}
